---
// BeP02TimeoutAmbiguity: added in the figure pass. Red = the part the reader owns or the failing path.
---
<figure class="bep2i">
  <div class="bep2i-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 296" role="img" aria-label="Two ways a request can time out. Left: the request is lost on the way out and the server never saw it. Right: the request arrives, the server does the work, and the response is lost on the way back. In both the client sees only a timeout.">
<text x="20" y="22" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>the request dies on the way out</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request chết trên đường đi</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="44" width="96" height="44" rx="8" class="box" /><text x="68" y="71" text-anchor="middle" class="m">client</text>
<rect x="320" y="44" width="96" height="44" rx="8" class="box" /><text x="368" y="71" text-anchor="middle" class="m">server</text>
<text x="218" y="52" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request</tspan></text>
<path d="M 118 66 L 210 66" class="lnr d" />
<path d="M 211 59 L 225 73 M 211 73 L 225 59" class="xr" />
<text x="218" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>lost on the way out</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mất trên đường đi</tspan></text>
<text x="368" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>never saw it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chưa hề thấy</tspan></text>
<text x="480" y="22" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>the request arrives, the answer dies</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request tới nơi, câu trả lời chết</tspan></text>
<rect x="480" y="44" width="96" height="44" rx="8" class="box" /><text x="528" y="71" text-anchor="middle" class="m">client</text>
<rect x="780" y="44" width="96" height="44" rx="8" class="box" /><text x="828" y="71" text-anchor="middle" class="m">server</text>
<text x="678" y="52" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request</tspan></text>
<path d="M 578 66 L 770.0 66.0" class="ln" /><polygon points="776,66 767.9,69.9 767.9,62.1" class="hd" />
<text x="828" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>did the work</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đã làm xong việc</tspan></text>
<text x="678" y="142" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>response</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>response</tspan></text>
<path d="M 776 152 L 584.0 152.0" class="lnr d" /><polygon points="578,152 586.1,148.1 586.1,155.9" class="hdr" />
<path d="M 671 145 L 685 159 M 671 159 L 685 145" class="xr" />
<text x="678" y="176" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>lost on the way back</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mất trên đường về</tspan></text>
<path d="M 230 108 L 355.6 223.9" class="lnr" /><polygon points="360,228 351.4,225.4 356.7,219.6" class="hdr" />
<path d="M 690 188 L 545.8 226.5" class="lnr" /><polygon points="540,228 546.8,222.1 548.8,229.7" class="hdr" />
<rect x="270" y="232" width="360" height="44" rx="8" class="boxr" />
<text x="450" y="259" text-anchor="middle" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>the client sees the same thing: a timeout</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>client thấy y hệt: một cú timeout</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A timeout is ambiguous: from the client side, a request that never arrived and one that arrived and lost its answer look identical.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Timeout là mơ hồ: từ phía client, request chưa hề tới và request đã tới nhưng mất câu trả lời trông y hệt nhau.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep2i { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep2i-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep2i svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep2i text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep2i .tt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep2i .b { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep2i .bb { fill: var(--text); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .bep2i .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep2i .f { fill: var(--text-faint); font-size: 12px; }
  .bep2i .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep2i .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep2i .boxr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep2i .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep2i .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep2i .d { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .bep2i .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep2i .hdr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep2i .xr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .bep2i .ok { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .bep2i .band { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep2i .bandr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep2i .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep2i .dotr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep2i figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
